#### 7. Sensitive Equality
**Academic name:** Sensitive Equality  
**Affected:** `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 122)  
**Risk:** Calling `.ToString()` ties the test to an exact string format. Any whitespace, currency symbol, or pluralization change breaks it.

```csharp
// ❌ Current — fragile ToString() comparison
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```

**Fix:** Assert on structured properties instead:

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
Assert.AreEqual(1, summary.ItemCount);
Assert.AreEqual(99.99m, summary.Total);
```

